{"1470810": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Plushy Store Tidy Up", "steam_appid": 1470810, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A Plushy Store in Complete Chaos</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >More than 1,600 plushies are scattered throughout one enormous store, and every shelf is waiting to be filled.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pick up plushies, carry several at once, sort them into their proper sections, and gradually transform the overwhelming mess into a colorful, perfectly organized store.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1470810/extras/1d7ef365341936ab7288d92d8112e8c1.poster.avif?t=1788199973\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1470810/extras/1d7ef365341936ab7288d92d8112e8c1.webm?t=1788199973\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1470810/extras/1d7ef365341936ab7288d92d8112e8c1.mp4?t=1788199973\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🧸 Two Ways to Play</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Relaxed Mode</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take your time and organize the store however you like. There is no correct arrangement—the goal is simply to fill every shelf and enjoy the satisfaction of watching the mess disappear.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Challenging Mode</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every plushy has a proper place, but the solution is not immediately obvious. Observe the plushies carefully, identify their shared traits, and work out where each one belongs.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1470810/extras/9d95d964f37c19ecfbf49273217d4866.avif?t=1788199973\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1470810/extras_big/9d95d964f37c19ecfbf49273217d4866.avif?t=1788199973 width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🧹 Tidy, Sort and Organize</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore the store, search through the enormous pile, and carry plushies to the shelves around you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Normal shelves must be filled with plushies from their appropriate sections, while special puzzle shelves require more careful observation and a specific solution.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🧩 Solve Shelf Puzzles</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Not every plushy can be placed anywhere.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pay attention to characteristics such as color, habitat, plushy type and food category. Compare the available plushies, understand each shelf’s rules, and find the arrangement that completes the puzzle.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >⚡ Upgrade Your Abilities</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Completing shelves rewards you with bulbs that can be spent on useful abilities.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• Carry more plushies at the same time<br>• Unlock sprinting and improve your movement speed<br>• Unlock and upgrade your magnet<br>• Jump higher to cross sides</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1470810/extras/d4d1c578420baa11030406521a9002dd.avif?t=1788199973\" width=1308 height=735 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose which abilities to improve and develop a faster, more efficient way to tidy the store.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🌤️ Watch the Store Transform</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The store’s atmosphere changes as time passes, moving from bright daytime into a cozy evening. Changing weather outside adds even more variety while you work inside.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every completed shelf makes the store feel calmer, cleaner and closer to being fully restored.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🦩 Free the Three Flamingoes</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Three flamingoes are waiting to return to the fountain at the center of the store.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Complete the different parts of the store, improve your abilities, and bring all three flamingoes together to achieve full completion.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1470810/extras/67b80b7bdfb281ba7e73207a92c09155.avif?t=1788199973\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1470810/extras_big/67b80b7bdfb281ba7e73207a92c09155.webp?t=1788199973 width=1560 height=877 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🏆 Complete Everything</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fill the normal shelves, solve every puzzle shelf, fully upgrade your abilities, unlock Steam achievements, and see how efficiently you can restore the entire store.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Whether you want a peaceful organizing experience or a satisfying brain teaser, Plushy Store Tidy Up lets you tidy the store your way.</p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A Plushy Store in Complete Chaos</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >More than 1,600 plushies are scattered throughout one enormous store, and every shelf is waiting to be filled.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pick up plushies, carry several at once, sort them into their proper sections, and gradually transform the overwhelming mess into a colorful, perfectly organized store.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1470810/extras/1d7ef365341936ab7288d92d8112e8c1.poster.avif?t=1788199973\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1470810/extras/1d7ef365341936ab7288d92d8112e8c1.webm?t=1788199973\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1470810/extras/1d7ef365341936ab7288d92d8112e8c1.mp4?t=1788199973\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🧸 Two Ways to Play</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Relaxed Mode</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take your time and organize the store however you like. There is no correct arrangement—the goal is simply to fill every shelf and enjoy the satisfaction of watching the mess disappear.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Challenging Mode</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every plushy has a proper place, but the solution is not immediately obvious. Observe the plushies carefully, identify their shared traits, and work out where each one belongs.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1470810/extras/9d95d964f37c19ecfbf49273217d4866.avif?t=1788199973\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1470810/extras_big/9d95d964f37c19ecfbf49273217d4866.avif?t=1788199973 width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🧹 Tidy, Sort and Organize</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore the store, search through the enormous pile, and carry plushies to the shelves around you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Normal shelves must be filled with plushies from their appropriate sections, while special puzzle shelves require more careful observation and a specific solution.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🧩 Solve Shelf Puzzles</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Not every plushy can be placed anywhere.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pay attention to characteristics such as color, habitat, plushy type and food category. Compare the available plushies, understand each shelf’s rules, and find the arrangement that completes the puzzle.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >⚡ Upgrade Your Abilities</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Completing shelves rewards you with bulbs that can be spent on useful abilities.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• Carry more plushies at the same time<br>• Unlock sprinting and improve your movement speed<br>• Unlock and upgrade your magnet<br>• Jump higher to cross sides</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1470810/extras/d4d1c578420baa11030406521a9002dd.avif?t=1788199973\" width=1308 height=735 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose which abilities to improve and develop a faster, more efficient way to tidy the store.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🌤️ Watch the Store Transform</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The store’s atmosphere changes as time passes, moving from bright daytime into a cozy evening. Changing weather outside adds even more variety while you work inside.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every completed shelf makes the store feel calmer, cleaner and closer to being fully restored.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🦩 Free the Three Flamingoes</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Three flamingoes are waiting to return to the fountain at the center of the store.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Complete the different parts of the store, improve your abilities, and bring all three flamingoes together to achieve full completion.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1470810/extras/67b80b7bdfb281ba7e73207a92c09155.avif?t=1788199973\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1470810/extras_big/67b80b7bdfb281ba7e73207a92c09155.webp?t=1788199973 width=1560 height=877 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🏆 Complete Everything</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fill the normal shelves, solve every puzzle shelf, fully upgrade your abilities, unlock Steam achievements, and see how efficiently you can restore the entire store.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Whether you want a peaceful organizing experience or a satisfying brain teaser, Plushy Store Tidy Up lets you tidy the store your way.</p>", "short_description": "Sort over 1,600 adorable plushies across 90 shelves in one enormous store. Organize freely in Relaxed Mode, or figure out where every plushy belongs in Challenge Mode while unlocking useful abilities", "supported_languages": "English, French, Italian, German, Spanish - Spain, Arabic, Japanese, Korean, Portuguese - Brazil, Portuguese - Portugal, Russian, Simplified Chinese", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1470810/91948d8ca712f41f8a4747501a3d8b233bbddb3c/header.jpg?t=1788199973", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1470810/2ed141335a0fc11e24b8767d01eac99b23a370e1/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1788199973", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1470810/2ed141335a0fc11e24b8767d01eac99b23a370e1/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1788199973", "website": "https://siv.games/", "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> 10 64-bit<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i3-6100 / AMD Ryzen 3 1200<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> NVIDIA GeForce GTX 750 Ti / AMD Radeon R7 360<br></li><li><stron